# Scaling Autonomous Swarm Logistics Across 14 Ports

### The Challenge
Apex Dynamics operated over 500 automated guided vehicles (AGVs) across 14 international port terminals. Legacy wifi telemetry caused signal dropouts and collision risks during peak container loading operations.

### The Solution
By deploying BITSOTRON Edge nodes on every vehicle coupled with the BITSOTRON Core neural runtime, AGVs were equipped with local decision micro-kernels that maintain swarm alignment even under complete network outages.

### Results
- Zero collision incidents recorded in 12 consecutive months.
- 38% increase in average container moves per hour.
- $14.2M saved in operational downtime.
